# Run r1102b, slice 2, boot A: group A superflat, the s2a world that s2_O0.qb built (old Rustic / Delightful / Kettle
# blocks), now with the two standalone jars removed (s2_setup.md, A). Probes in srv/kubejs/server_scripts: zz_zq_probe.js
# (prep_srv.sh), zz_zp_probe.js (tools/scratch_query/zp_probe.js: sneak, eat, hunger, effects, inv), zz_count.js and
# zz_trades.js (tools/fungi_probe/zcount.js, ztrades.js).
# Home: the marker tagged s2home (capture H). y = H2 is the air layer above the superflat grass (H2-1). Lanes (z offset):
# O0 blocks 0..6; FR-02 10; RD-04 14; RD-05 18; RD-13 22; RD-14 26; RD-15 30; RD-16 34..39; RD-17 44; RD-18 48; RD-23 56;
# RD-24 60..90 (x 0..30); RD-33 94; DF-04 98; DF-05 102; RSP 106..130; CN-04 134; CDQ-01 138; CDF-06 142.
# Loot rolls land in the pit at x+60..+62 (killed before each row). Bots: one name per row.
# Order: old-world checks, boot greps, recipes / tags / foods, block use, loot,
# trades, then /dumpall + offline scans. No /reload in this file (SQ-RD-25 was run earlier).
pace 2

## SQ-RD-03 | old world: Rustic 1.3.0 blocks keep their state under the 1.7.0 port
bootexpect Done \(
bootreject member rusticdelight is loaded from|member delightful is loaded from
bootreject (?i)(missing registry|unidentified mapping).*rusticdelight
bootreject Failed to set block association
> data get entity @e[type=minecraft:marker,tag=s2home,limit=1] Pos
capture H entity data: \[(-?\d+)\.\d+d, (-?\d+)\.\d+d, (-?\d+)\.\d+d\]
> forceload add {H1-16} {H3-16} {H1+80} {H3+176}
sleep 5
> gamerule doDaylightCycle false
> weather clear 100000
> difficulty easy
> zcount {H1+2} {H2} {H3} {H1+17} {H2} {H3}
waitlog \[zcount\] entities 30
expect \[zcount\] blocks .*rusticdelight:honey_pancakes=1
expect \[zcount\] blocks .*rusticdelight:bell_pepper_red_crate=1
expect \[zcount\] blocks .*rusticdelight:cotton_boll_crate=1
expect \[zcount\] blocks .*rusticdelight:bell_peppers=1
expect \[zcount\] blocks .*rusticdelight:potted_wild_coffee=1
expect \[zcount\] blocks .*rusticdelight:cherry_blossom_cheesecake=1
> execute if block {H1+2} {H2} {H3} rusticdelight:honey_pancakes[servings=3] run say RD03 pancakes still 3
> execute if block {H1+8} {H2} {H3} rusticdelight:bell_peppers[age=4] run say RD03 pepper crop age 4
> execute if block {H1+9} {H2} {H3} rusticdelight:cotton[age=2] run say RD03 cotton age 2
> execute if block {H1+10} {H2} {H3} rusticdelight:coffee[age=3] run say RD03 coffee age 3
expect RD03 pancakes still 3
expect RD03 pepper crop age 4
expect RD03 cotton age 2
expect RD03 coffee age 3
look zcount line: wild bell peppers, wild coffee, wild cotton, coffee beans bag and chocolate pancakes also present (one each)

